<title>JAPAN: Keihin Express Rail - 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Keihin Express Rail - 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		144.87		vs	  138.34</p>
<p> Operating	   19.96		vs	   19.61</p>
<p> Current		6.54		vs	    5.71</p>
<p> Net		    3.19		vs	    3.15</p>
<p> EPS		    6.25 yen	  vs	    6.34 yen</p>
